      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can currently check if a user is in TPV using the following workaround:\n\n```\n\nif (VRCCameraSettings.ScreenCamera.CameraMode != VRCCameraMode.Screen && VRCCameraSettings.ScreenCamera.CameraMode != VRCCameraMode.FocusView)\n\n{\n\n          //User is in TPV             \n\n}\n\n```\n\nAn event would be better, because constantly checking this is not performant-",
